  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>Maximum scale-out limits for Azure Functions on Linux Elastic Premium plans have been increased in the following regions:</p>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td><strong>Regions</strong></td>\r\n\t\t\t<td><strong>New scale-out limit</strong></td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Australia East</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>40</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Central US</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>40</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>East US</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>60</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>East US 2</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>40</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>North Europe</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>40</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>South Central US</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>40</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>West Europe</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>40</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/azure/azure-functions/functions-premium-plan#region-max-scale-out\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Learn More.</a></p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "Maximum scale-out limits for Azure Functions on Linux Elastic Premium plans have been increased in the following regions:\n\nRegions\n\nNew scale-out limit\n\nAustralia East\n\n40\n\nCentral US\n\n40\n\nEast US\n\n60\n\nEast US 2\n\n40\n\nNorth Europe\n\n40\n\nSouth Central US\n\n40\n\nWest Europe\n\n40\n\nLearn More."
  },
